  <data name="S_ThisGestureWasMeantTo.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>This gesture was meant to work exactly like on SteamOS - hold Legion R and tilt the left stick. On Windows, holding Legion L or R for more than about 5 seconds is hardcoded in the controller's own firmware to toggle that grip's connection off and on (a real Legion Space feature) - not something GoTweaks, or any app, can override. None of the trigger options below have this limitation.</value></data>
